<%= header_section(@subject) %>
<div>
  <p>
    We checked the page you reported for <strong><%= @product_name %></strong>, and your takedown notice is ready.
  </p>
  <p>
    Open the notice and read it. If it is correct, confirm each statement and sign it.
  </p>
  <p>
    <%= link_to "Review and sign the notice", @sign_url, class: "button primary" %>
  </p>
  <p>
    After you sign, we send the notice from support@gumroad.com with you in CC, and we email you when the site
    responds.
  </p>
</div>
